cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this repository when using its code or archived simulation data. For the
  research findings, also cite the final paper using its published bibliographic
  details.
title: "V2G Multi-Market Analysis: Code and Simulation Results"
authors:
  - name: "GreenPow Labs GmbH"
    city: "Berlin"
    country: "Germany"
    website: "https://www.greenpow.io/"
contact:
