abstract: >-
  Research code, data-processing and EV-profile generation workflows, model files,
  analysis outputs, and 72 executed runs accompanying a study of vehicle-to-grid
  demand response in local energy communities. Some restricted market and carbon-intensity
  inputs are not included and must be obtained from their providers.
url: "https://github.com/GreenPow-Labs/v2g-lec-multi-market-arbitrage"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GreenPow-Labs/v2g-lec-multi-market-arbitrage"
